=   entry .Error   raised when text is not a PEM block
-     detail
+     detail

-         Error `↯/s.105.1`: _could not parse PEM content because `reason`_. Raised by `Pem.aggregable`,
-         `Pem.aggregableAll` and the `read[X in Pem]` liftings:
+         エラー `↯/s.105.1`：_could not parse PEM content because `reason`_。
+         `Pem.aggregable`、`Pem.aggregableAll`、`read[X in Pem]` の持ち上げが発生させる。

=         `Pem.aggregableAll` and the `read[X in Pem]` liftings:
=
-         ```tabular
+         ```tabular

-         column  Case
-         column  Code
-         column  Message
-         column  Note
-         row  `BeginMissing`  1  _the BEGIN line could not be found_  the first non-blank line is not a `BEGIN` boundary; also an empty input
-         row  `EndMissing`  2  _the END line could not be found_  the input ends before an `END` boundary
-         row  `BadBase64`  3  _could not parse the BASE-64 PEM message_  the body is not base64
-         row  `EmptyFile`  4  _the file was empty_  declared, but not raised by the current parser
+         column  ケース
+         column  コード
+         column  メッセージ
+         column  備考
+         row  `BeginMissing`  1  _the BEGIN line could not be found_  最初の空白でない行が `BEGIN` の境界でない。空の入力も含む
+         row  `EndMissing`  2  _the END line could not be found_  入力が `END` の境界より前に終わる
+         row  `BadBase64`  3  _could not parse the BASE-64 PEM message_  本文が base64 でない
+         row  `EmptyFile`  4  _the file was empty_  宣言されているが、現在のパーサーは発生させない

=         row  `EmptyFile`  4  _the file was empty_  declared, but not raised by the current parser
